    <section class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 class="text-color">Application Deadlines & Updates</h2>
      <p>As of January 9, 2025, the application deadlines for Alex Ekwueme Federal University, Ndufu-Alike (AE-FUNAI) for the 2024/2025 academic session have passed.</p>
      <p>The Post-UTME/Direct Entry screening registration was extended to <strong>September 30, 2024</strong>. For more details, visit the official <a href="https://funai.edu.ng/news/notice-of-further-extension-of-the-2024-2025-academic-session-post-utme-direct-entry-online-screening-registration-exercise" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FUNAI announcement</a>.</p>
      <p>The supplementary admission application closed on <strong>November 20, 2024</strong>. More information can be found <a href="https://funai.edu.ng/news/application-for-the-2024-2025-session-supplementary-admission" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</p>
      <p>For the most accurate and up-to-date information on upcoming admission deadlines and application procedures, regularly check the official <a href="https://funai.edu.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AE-FUNAI website</a> or contact the admissions office directly.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">FUNAI Admissions Information</h2>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li><strong>How to Apply for Postgraduate Programs at FUNAI:</strong> <a href="https://funai.edu.ng/postgraduate-application" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here to learn more</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>FUNAI Undergraduate Programs and Courses Offered:</strong> <a href="/funai-post-gradute-guide-procedures/guide">Explore the list of courses</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>FUNAI Admission Portal Login:</strong> <a href="https://portal.funai.edu.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Access the portal</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>How Much is FUNAI Acceptance Fee?</strong> The acceptance fee for FUNAI is available <a href="https://funai.edu.ng/acceptance-fee" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>FUNAI Scholarship Opportunities for New Students:</strong> Learn more about scholarships <a href="https://funai.edu.ng/scholarships" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>What is the Admission Process at FUNAI?</strong> <a href="/funai-admissionprocedures">View the detailed process</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>FUNAI Admission Status Check:</strong> Check your status <a href="https://portal.funai.edu.ng/admission-status" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">FUNAI Admission Process Steps</h2>
      <p>The admission process at FUNAI includes the following steps:</p>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li>Application through the <a href="https://portal.funai.edu.ng" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Admission Portal</a>.</li>
        <li>Submission of O'Level results and other required documents.</li>
        <li>Participation in the Post-UTME screening exercise.</li>
        <li>Meeting the cut-off mark for the desired program.</li>
        <li>Acceptance of the admission offer and payment of fees.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="/funai-post-gradute-guide-procedures/guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here for the detailed admission process</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">FUNAI Important Dates and Deadlines</h2>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li><strong>1. FUNAI Admission Form Closing Date:</strong> The deadline for submitting the FUNAI admission form for the 2024/2025 academic session was August 31, 2024.</li>
        <li><strong>2. Application Window for Next Year:</strong> FUNAI typically starts accepting applications for the new academic year from May. Keep checking the FUNAI website for updates.</li>
        <li><strong>3. International Student Application Deadline:</strong> International applications for the 2024/2025 session closed on June 30, 2024.</li>
        <li><strong>4. FUNAI Post UTME Exam Date:</strong> The Post UTME exam for FUNAI was held on September 15, 2024.</li>
        <li><strong>5. FUNAI Matriculation Date:</strong> The matriculation ceremony for fresh students took place on October 1, 2024.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
